category: Libs
build-depends: cygport flac-devel liboggz-devel libsndfile-devel libvorbis-devel speex-devel
sdesc: "Simple programming interface for decoding and encoding audio data (utilities)"
ldesc: "libfishsound provides a simple programming interface for decoding and encoding
audio data using the Xiph.org codecs (FLAC, Speex and Vorbis)."
